=== narrow ===

 draw every block that holds nothing


Every block below draws nothing, so a
single blank stands between each of
these lines.

A quote held nothing.

A bullet held nothing.

A numbered item held nothing.

A bullet inside a bullet held nothing.

A heading held nothing.

A fence held nothing.

A Go fence held nothing.

A quote inside a quote held nothing.

A quote inside a bullet held nothing.

A link definition drew nothing.

And that is the last of them.
